sections.body:
If anything cannot be counted, a red box at the top says what and where to fix it:

• a diagnosis with no HMIS code — enter the code from the national classification under Clinic Setup → Conditions;
• a finding whose service is not linked to a diagnosis — set Diagnosis (as a finding) under Clinic Setup → Services;
• patients with no birth date — they are counted under Age unknown; an estimated age is enough.

The system never guesses a code. Check the age groups against the current form from your health office.
